# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ASTRA Terminal — what git should never carry
#
# Without this file GitHub Desktop offered to commit 968 files, because the
# Electron runtime under node_modules/ is 273 MB and holds a 100 MB+
# electron.exe. GitHub refuses any file over 100 MB, so committing it would
# have made the repository impossible to push — permanently, since the file
# would stay in the history even after being deleted.
#
# Everything ignored here is re-created by "npm install" or by running the app.
# Nothing you have written by hand is excluded.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# the Electron runtime and every other installed package
node_modules/

# Python bytecode from the MT5 bridge
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Electron build output, if a packaged app is ever produced
dist/
out/
release/
desktop/cache/

# editor and operating-system litter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# logs and scratch
*.log
npm-debug.log*
_to_delete/
